2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]: Memory (Multi-Provider):
2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]:   - Auto-detects provider from request (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, etc.)
2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]:   - Anthropic: Uses native memory tool (memory_20250818) - subscription safe
2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]:   - OpenAI/Gemini/Others: Uses function calling format
2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]:   - All providers share the same semantic vector store backend
2026-11-09T20:59:47+09:00 main headroom[1730]:   - Storage mode: project (per-project DB by default — set x-headroom-project-id / x-headroom-cwd to override)
